{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとお久しぶりな更新になってしまいました<(_ _*)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はちょっといつもと違う感じのBlogを...♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HBCカップジャンプのEDに乃木坂が流れてた!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>そうなんです!有り難いです<(_ _*)>\n函館の祖父母が喜んでいました!また、北海道でのお仕事したいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物好きですか?変わったペットだと何を飼いたい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>動物好きだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃「ちぇりー」「チロ」て言うハムスター飼ってました!\n変わったペットかぁー。。。\n私、キリンが大好きなので「キリン」。リアルなフィギュアも持ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんは今でも「れいか姉さん」て呼ぶの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>随分懐かしいことを(笑\nアレは一時のもので、ほとんど呼ばれたことありません←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂で最強は誰?乃木メンて全員が最強キャラでしょうけど(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>あなたの言う通り、乃木メンは全員最強キャラ。今日、番組のトーク打合せの時に改めて感じてきました((笑  いいグループ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握で履いてた靴どこの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>R&E というブランドの靴です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が持っている靴のほとんどはココのものです。女の子にはお馴染みブランドだね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶漬けに必ず入れるものは?\n>>>お餅。ごはんじゃなくて、お餅。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に行ったことがなくて、よくわからないのですが......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>握手会すごい楽しいはず♪私は色んな人と話せるから、毎回楽しみなイベントです!\n何回か来て下さると、顔を覚えているから色々なお話をするようになります＊＊\n好きな音楽の話、洋服の話、メンバーの話、学校や会社での話、お互いの近況報告......軽い話から真剣な話、本当に色んな話をしてます!!\n興味がわいた時は、是非会いに来てください♪\nいつでも待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の更新のうえに、短いBlogで皆さんごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また早めに更新出来るように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな本当にごめんね...\nでも、大好きなみんなのこと忘れたわけじゃないからねーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/25/1630130/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!!"}],"source":"archive"}